      "widgets_values": [
        "We are using quantized weights in this workflow, the original Boogu-Image repo is [here](https://huggingface.co/Boogu)\n\n## Model links on [Comfy-org Repo](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Boogu-Image)\n\n\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [boogu_image_base_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Boogu-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/boogu_image_base_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen3vl_8b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Boogu-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [flux1_vae_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Boogu-Image/resolve/main/vae/flux1_vae_bf16.safetensors)\n\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n└── 📂 models/\n    ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n    │   ├── boogu_image_base_bf16.safetensors\n    │   ├── boogu_image_base_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n    │   ├── boogu_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors\n    │   └── boogu_image_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n    ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n    │   └── qwen3vl_8b_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n    └── 📂 vae/\n        └── flux1_vae_bf16.safetensors\n```\n"
